fr fr An esoteric port of the jakedgy compression codec using cursed syntax.
fr fr High compression codec achieving ~6.40MB on 1M GitHub events.
fr fr
fr fr Key optimizations:
fr fr 1. Null-separated name dictionary - lets zstd find patterns naturally
fr fr 2. Delta-encoded repo_ids with sentinel encoding for single-name repos
fr fr 3. Columnar layout with per-column zstd compression
fr fr 4. Timestamp sorting within row groups for optimal ID delta encoding
fr fr 5. 2-bit category encoding for ID deltas (0/2/4 as common values)
fr fr 6. 2-bit category encoding for timestamp deltas (0/1/2 as common values)
fr fr 7. Optimized 140K row group size for best compression ratio
fr fr ============================================================================

